CORE INFERENCE
The frontier is converging on a three-stage problem: DISCOVER ->
VERIFY -> AUTHORIZE. Discovery is becoming cheap and effectively
unbounded. Payment makes capabilities purchasable at runtime. RSI
makes the harness itself mutable. Therefore the scarce security
primitive is no longer a static allowlist; it is a continuously
recomputed, empirically attested capability graph with an authority
spine that the agent cannot silently rewrite.
